<title>USA: IWI Holding says sued by shareholder.</title>
<headline>IWI Holding says sued by shareholder.</headline>
<dateline>WESTMONT, Ill. 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>IWI Holding Ltd said it was served with a lawsuit filed by a shareholder who alleges fraud, misrepresentation and negligence by the company.</p>
<p>The company said the shareholder filed for class action status and seeks $11 million in damages.</p>
<p>&quot;The company believes that the charges are without merit and...will fully defend itself against this action,&quot; said the company, a jewelry distributor.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
